        <body>
            <div xml:id="d67-a2">

                <pb facs="0128" n="782" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg782"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    169.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Reply of His Majesty the Tenno to the foreign
                        representatives, January</hi> 1, 1875.</head>
                <p>I am extremely rejoiced at the expression of sincere congratulation proffered to
                    me by the representatives of friendly states on the occasion of the New Year. I
                    hope that the sovereigns and the presidents of the friendly states will enjoy
                    the New Year in in health and prosperity.</p>
                <p>I congratulate you on having entered on a new year in good health.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
